XfzGsQ7kNvwFXl3Vn&_nc_oc=AdrCk6zKgeZckv1QRU0QPB3_ViPXlmCPpAtbMpaQuIbn47m6FaCRdqFlYR6bBlaGlRo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPH27bKq-Fs7vniCi1l9PWxPjYHky7TkOrUtf4OXeqpRw&oe=6AE5ED48"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "TrailerCoverImage.png", "id": "1307953604354318", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619187_1307953607687651_415736046812000494_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1drurODRpCkQ7kNvwHgI6IA&_nc_oc=AdqBenK3uD1LamHiKG0xSpOGw5nmmL6D-MwJi3AsDbAOv2DTCodsDXcXAB5za--ZAaE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPKcZffB2nasVsnUhJS5AmCfXvL3k1Rn_DLZDlOcgfx_A&oe=6AE6190E"}, "display_name": "LiveXR Workflow", "keywords": ["Training", "Senario", "Enterprise", "Corporate", "Educational"], "long_description": "About \"LiveXR Workflow\"\n\"LiveXR Workflow\" is a service specialized in procedural and process-based training. It allows users to review formal procedures (the correct path) by replicating various real-world scenarios.\n\nKey Features:\n\nSkill-Based Modes: Offers Beginner and Expert modes to provide tailored training suited to the user's skill level.\n\nImmersive Hands-On Experience: Enables users to interact with objects (grab, move, rotate, etc.) and verify checklist steps within a VR environment.\n\nPerformance Tracking: Records the duration of each step, which can be utilized to measure training effectiveness and drive operational improvements.\n\nPre-Training Preparation: By allowing users to learn the working environment and operational methods in advance, it minimizes mistakes and confusion, supporting safe and efficient training.", "short_description": "A solution specialized in procedural and process-based training"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "LiveXR_Workflow_Icon.png", "id": "1598811945581411", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619485_1598811948914